Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.20,0:00:20.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}You couldn’t even keep a small promise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.88,0:00:27.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}And you just glossed over it with a big yawn
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.50,0:00:37.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I couldn’t find even a small bit of happiness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.90,0:00:44.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}So tears were falling from my big eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.68,0:00:49.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Because just being loved isn’t enough
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.02,0:00:53.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}And because only being happy makes me uneasy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:59.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}And because when there’s only kindness, it’s meaningless,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.80,0:01:02.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I’ll take you with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.94,0:01:04.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Miserable, miserable brilliance
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.04,0:01:13.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Don’t let us be separated, because I’ll do anything for you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.76,0:01:15.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I’ll take you with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.92,0:01:17.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Miserable, miserable brilliance
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.02,0:01:26.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Don’t let us be separated, because I’ll do anything for you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.73,0:01:47.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}From now on, I wonder what we’ll become
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.11,0:01:53.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Right now, I’m thinking that it probably doesn’t matter
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.03,0:02:00.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Because when there’s nothing but hatred, it won’t end
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.33,0:02:05.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}And because I’m not satisfied with just sadness
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.67,0:02:11.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}And because when we’re nothing but strict with each other, we don’t smile,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.15,0:02:16.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I’ll take you with me, so come over this way, darling
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.41,0:02:24.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Don’t let us be separated, because I’ll always forgive you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.11,0:02:29.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I’ll take you with me, so come over this way, darling
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.35,0:02:38.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Don’t let us be separated, because I’ll always forgive you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.19,0:02:45.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Anywhere, anywhere, anywhere
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.67,0:02:52.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}As long as we’re together somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.23,0:02:55.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I’ll take you with me, so…
